<p>The weekly HMRC <strong>sandbox healthcheck</strong> failed after all retries.</p>

<p>Error: <code><%= @error %></code></p>

<p>This is our early-warning that HMRC may have changed something in the MTD sandbox
(fraud prevention header spec, OAuth, or availability). Real filing is unaffected, but
it is worth checking the
<a href="https://github.com/hmrc/income-tax-mtd-changelog">HMRC MTD changelog</a> and
running <code>bin/rails hmrc:fph_validate</code> on the server to see the detail.</p>
